{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2021-05-13 08:00:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON JOINS WORLD HEALTH ORGANIZATION IN EFFORTS TO PREVENT SPREAD OF EBOLA IN WEST AFRICA', 'text': "NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J., MAY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) (THE COMPANY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE WORLD HEALTH ORGANIZATION (WHO) AND THE GOVERNMENT OF SIERRA LEONE HAVE BEGUN ADMINISTERING THE COMPANY'S EBOLA VACCINE REGIMEN AS PART OF A WHO EARLY ACCESS CLINICAL PROGRAM AIMED AT PREVENTING FURTHER SPREAD OF EBOLA IN WEST AFRICA."}